{
  "id": "pl-wyrozniki-3",
  "description": "Polish three-letter plate prefixes: voivodeship letter (Załącznik nr 13, col. 4) + two-letter powiat discriminant (col. 5). Built as the per-voivodeship cross product of the voivodeship letters with the two-letter powiat codes (§ 31 ust. 2-3). Includes WW/VB/NX added by Dz.U. 2025 poz. 939 (in force 2025-07-30) and CE/CM, TR/TN, OZ/OP added by Dz.U. 2026 poz. 891 § 1 pkt 9 (in force one month after its 2026-07-03 promulgation; that window is not enforced here). After powiat mergers the former discriminants remain in use (§ 31 ust. 4), so the annex is the closed set of legal codes, not the set observed on new plates only.",
  "sources": [
